{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Temple of Tianwen\u2014a place where reality and dreams intertwine. It belongs to San-Yuan Star (also known as the Land of Manifestations), yet exists apart from the real world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken here as a dog Xiangling. The temple\u2019s master, Qin Sanhe, entrusts you with a mission: breathe life into this desolate land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To do so, you must step into shifting phantasms, recovering memory projections of houses and city facilities to pave streets and construct buildings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, you\u2019ll encounter familiar figures\u2014departed souls, dreamers crossing through time, and divine aspects born of worship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide them home, live alongside them, and forge lasting bonds. In time, this barren nameless land will grow into something more:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a true home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 Phantasm Exploration</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the dreamscapes, face enemies born of memory and emotion, and collect over 100+ different houses and city facilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038290/extras/848437de47614624ba6f79c36e5b3aae.poster.avif?t=1759946833\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038290/extras/848437de47614624ba6f79c36e5b3aae.webm?t=1759946833\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038290/extras/848437de47614624ba6f79c36e5b3aae.mp4?t=1759946833\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 Sanctuary Building</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freely place structures, expand districts, and transform the ruins step by step into a thriving home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038290/extras/f53b814c4d7bf67ebaec7110d5ca59f9.poster.avif?t=1759946833\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038290/extras/f53b814c4d7bf67ebaec7110d5ca59f9.webm?t=1759946833\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038290/extras/f53b814c4d7bf67ebaec7110d5ca59f9.mp4?t=1759946833\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 Bonds and Stories</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring lost souls back, share daily life with them, hear their stories, give gifts, trigger special events, and even go on dates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perhaps, within this sanctuary, you\u2019ll find someone truly meant for you...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038290/extras/f9f62fb1b38b0d80c7a41accfdca7665.poster.avif?t=1759946833\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038290/extras/f9f62fb1b38b0d80c7a41accfdca7665.webm?t=1759946833\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038290/extras/f9f62fb1b38b0d80c7a41accfdca7665.mp4?t=1759946833\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4038290?t=1759946833","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4038290?t=1759946833","capsule_image":"https://shared.a